{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727580/extras/Header_Capsule_28_.png?t=1747720328\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RECALL NEWS is a co-op horror report wrapped in glitched layers of reality.</strong><br>You are a team of four, trapped in broken and unreadable locations \u2014 armed only with a radio, vague orders, and instructions from something that calls itself &quot;Command.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727580/extras/2.png?t=1747720328\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727580/extras/1.gif?t=1747720328\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect clues. Walk the wrong way.</strong><br>Your job is to find, extract, and sell strange decorative objects from fractured worlds. Why? You\u2019re not authorized to know. Just don\u2019t drop the vase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727580/extras/3.png?t=1747720328\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727580/extras/2.gif?t=1747720328\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reality won\u2019t hold for long.</strong><br>Each zone is unstable. Lights flicker, rooms distort, and the voice on the radio grows less human the deeper you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727580/extras/4.png?t=1747720328\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727580/extras/3.gif?t=1747720328\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Communication is your only weapon \u2014 and your weakest link.</strong><br>Talking helps. One teammate spots a trap, another calls out a step into the void. But the deeper you go, the more voices echo on the air.<br>Not all of them belong to your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727580/extras/7.png?t=1747720328\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727580/extras/4.gif?t=1747720328\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RECALL NEWS is horror about learning too much.</strong><br>And about selling your grandmother\u2019s statue to unlock a metaphysical prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re here to report. At least, that\u2019s what they told you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3727580?t=1747720328","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3727580?t=1747720328","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727580/f74fde56144685b2d567b6f048dfd937a374c5f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747720328","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727580/f74fde56144685b2d567b6f048dfd937a374c5f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747720328","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full